<Sync time="1294.423"/>
"Ke...," nikilia, "ke:mah" nikilia kipahtihkeh, i:n, kita sah" nikilia.
<Sync time="1298.393"/>
"A:mo mitspahtilihkeh" kihtowa. Nikilia "kanah, a:mo ne:chpahtilihkeh. 
<Sync time="1302.21"/>
Tine:chkahkaya:w" nikilia. "Tine:chmakak yo:n a:mat pero a:mo servi:roh" nikilia, "ka:n kwaltiak" nikilia.
<Sync time="1308.643"/>
"¿Ke:yeh?".
<Sync time="1309.733"/>
"Pos ta: yeh ne:chilia ne:n tein tapahtia" nikilia "ke kineki tomi:n
<Sync time="1313.603"/>
para ika takowas *resorte**" nikilia "wa:n ox *clavo**, toni" nikilia "kikwih wa:n nikwetskilih sah" nikilia.
<Sync time="1320.343"/>
